msgstr ""

msgid "To help write classes with rich comparison methods, a new decorator :func:`functools.total_ordering` will use existing equality and inequality methods to fill in the remaining methods."
msgstr ""

msgid "For example, supplying *__eq__* and *__lt__* will enable :func:`~functools.total_ordering` to fill-in *__le__*, *__gt__* and *__ge__*::"
msgstr ""

